{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"text\": \"刚尝到的安宁还在，他身体先一紧，发现现实里还过不上那种生活；他懊恼自己才刚沉进满足，就忘了还有事要面对。\",\n      \"key\": \"安宁还在\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他当初不肯再等，是怕珍惜的东西继续受损，光怀念也护不住它们。\",\n      \"key\": \"珍惜的东西\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他想重新投入，却不敢再像从前那样不管不顾，怕争取时太用力，会把刚找回的温柔也弄丢。\",\n      \"key\": \"刚找回的温柔\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他原以为想清不肯再等的理由就能安心，可真要往前，他还是拿不准怎么做。\",\n      \"key\": \"拿不准怎么做\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"失效\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R32\", \"R35\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并补回自责\",\n      \"why\": \"保留安宁仍真切、现实里的生活却未实现，以及身体先于念头的反应；直白写出他懊恼自己才刚沉进满足，就忘了还有事要面对，不再另设重复的自我追问。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R33\", \"R34\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"把不能只靠怀念的念头落到他当初不肯再等的具体理由上：他不愿看着珍惜的东西继续受损，也知道光怀念护不住它们。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R36\", \"R37\", \"R38\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他想重新投入却无法像从前那样不管不顾，以及害怕争取时太用力会弄丢温柔的冲突；删去重复概括两边风险的对仗句。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R39\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留原以为理由足够就能安心、实际行动时却仍然迟疑的困境，改成他拿不准具体该怎么做，并以跨段箭头接回最初寻找足够理由的期待。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9c378e08-7d72-4455-b73b-1a1b474f03a2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T142643009405Z", "elapsed_seconds": 749.64, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T14:39:12.649864+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b74c3350fcb5bcda512627cd6ec677a7b4862ce2d978234c75df80f1ef389399", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_